@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Video Suggestion System

[*] --> ReceiveRequest

state "Receive request" as ReceiveRequest
ReceiveRequest : entry / New video suggestion request received
ReceiveRequest : do / Log the request details
ReceiveRequest : exit / Proceed to identify user

state IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / User makes a request
IdentifyUser : do / Verify user identity
IdentifyUser : exit / User identified successfully

state GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / User identified
GatherVideos : do / Collect videos based on preferences and trends
GatherVideos : exit / Videos gathered with initial data

state AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / Videos collected
AddDetails : do / Enrich with thumbnails and view counts
AddDetails : exit / Details added to suggestions

state SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions : entry / Suggestions ready
SendSuggestions : do / Transmit video suggestions to user
SendSuggestions : exit / User receives the suggestions

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos
GatherVideos --> AddDetails
AddDetails --> SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions --> [*]

@enduml
